<title>BELGIUM: Belgian producer prices down in January.</title>
<headline>Belgian producer prices down in January.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Economics Ministry released the following data -</p>
<p>    PRODUCER PRICES		 January December November</p>
<p>    General index (base=1980)   139.14  139.32   139.02</p>
<p>    Change in pct vs pvs mth    -0.13   +0.22    n/a</p>
<p>    Food, drink, tobacco index  147.90  147.52   147.31</p>
<p>    Change in pct vs pvs mth    +0.26   +0.14    n/a</p>
<p>    Energy index		    104.58  105.79   104.96</p>
<p>    Change in pct vs pvs mth    -1.14   +0.79    n/a</p>
<p>    Index ex oil products	 147.30  147.61   147.58</p>
<p>    Change in pct vs pvs mth    -0.21   +0.02    n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - the main decrease was for electricity, the main increase for oil products.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
